    "en": "Section 1."
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Creation of Barangay 201, Zone 20. — The areas of Kalayaan Village, Teachers Bliss and Balabag are hereby separated from Barangay 183, Zone 20 in the City of Pasay, Metropolitan Manila to constitute a distinct and independent barangay to be known as Barangay 201."
   }
  },
